              %em suspension spectrum – Smash-monoidal diagonalspectrum#SmashMonoidalDiagonals)
          %p
            With this, given a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead-generalized+cohomology+theory"} Whitehead-generalized cohomology theory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
