                  \\big)
          %p
            the smash-monoidal diagonal structure
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:SmashMonoidalDiagonalOnSuspensionSpectra"} (1)
            on suspension spectra serves to define the cup product
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
